endobj
267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (The pipeline runs two separate extraction passes, one for safety and one for non-safety. Because the two passes never see each other, the same quote gets filed in both categories. This produced 207 cross-bucket duplicates across 48 files. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
268 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (Solution:)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (Run a single extraction pass that reads the full transcript and forces the model to commit to one category per quote. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
